msgid "构建 ReliefNT"
msgstr "Building ReliefNT"

msgid "准备与构建"
msgstr "Preparation and Build"

msgid ""
"使用 Linux、GNU Make 4.3+、Clang/LLVM、compiler-rt、bison、flex、 pkg-config 和 ncurses 开发输入。从本仓根目录执行::"
msgstr ""
"Use Linux, GNU Make 4.3+, Clang/LLVM, compiler-rt, bison, flex, pkg-config, and ncurses "
"development inputs. Run from this repository's root::"

msgid ""
"fetch 获取锁定 Unifont，正常构建不隐式联网。配置在 O/.config；menuconfig 编辑，olddefconfig 保留并补充。工具链由 "
"configs/toolchains 指定，显式命令行 覆盖目标工具；HOSTCC 独立。原版引擎摘要见 scripts/kbuild-source.json。"
msgstr ""
"fetch obtains the pinned Unifont; normal builds do not access the network implicitly. "
"Configuration is stored in O/.config; menuconfig edits it, and olddefconfig preserves it and fills"
" in missing options. configs/toolchains specifies the toolchain; explicit command-line settings "
"override target tools, while HOSTCC is independent. Upstream engine digests are recorded in "
"scripts/kbuild-source.json."

msgid "配置归属"
msgstr "Configuration Ownership"

msgid ""
"Kconfig 只提供内核实际消费的选项。生产 defconfig 默认将驱动内建， 已完成生命周期支持的部件可选择 m，构建为针对 ReliefNT 的原生 .ko。 调度、内存、VFS "
"和启动基础保持内置；具体边界见 :doc:`../core-api/drivers`。 模块开发测试默认关闭；模块构建和 prepared SDK 见 :doc:`modules`。 编译策略仍由"
" PROFILE=debug|release 控制，工具链、版本后缀和 SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH 使用独立 Make 参数。"
msgstr ""
"Kconfig exposes only options actually consumed by the kernel. Production defconfig builds drivers "
"in by default; components with complete lifecycle support can be set to m to build native ReliefNT"
" .ko files. Scheduling, memory, VFS, and boot foundations remain built in; see :doc:`../core-"
"api/drivers` for the boundaries. Module development tests are disabled by default; see "
":doc:`modules` for module builds and the prepared SDK. Compilation policy remains controlled by "
"PROFILE=debug|release; toolchains, version suffixes, and SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH use separate Make "
"parameters."

msgid ""
"应用、系统镜像、激活策略和 QEMU 参数只属于 ReliefOS 主仓，内核不 source 主仓 Kconfig。从旧输出复制配置后运行 olddefconfig，会由原版 conf "
"移除外来符号。 ``make test-kconfig`` 使用隔离输出验证该边界与重复同步的稳定性，并属于默认 test。 保留的 Linux Kconfig "
"引擎及其测试夹具是上游构建输入，不是本内核提供的配置项。"
msgstr ""
"Applications, system images, activation policy, and QEMU parameters belong only to the ReliefOS "
"main repository; the kernel does not source its Kconfig. Running olddefconfig after copying a "
"configuration from old output lets upstream conf remove foreign symbols. ``make test-kconfig`` "
"uses isolated output to verify this boundary and stability under repeated synchronization, and is "
"part of the default test target. The retained Linux Kconfig engine and its test fixtures are "
"upstream build inputs, not configuration options offered by this kernel."

msgid "产物与版本"
msgstr "Artifacts and Versioning"

msgid ""
"产物在 O/generated/system：kernel.sys、kernel.debug。 vDSO 有独立 PIC/链接参数，仅嵌入对象进入内核。headers_install "
"按白名单导出， install 发布带摘要的清单，不消费父仓私有实现。"
msgstr ""
"Artifacts are in O/generated/system: kernel.sys and kernel.debug. The vDSO uses separate "
"PIC/linker parameters; only its embedded object enters the kernel. headers_install exports an "
"allowlisted set, and install publishes a manifest with digests without consuming private "
"implementations from the parent repository."

msgid ""
"版本来自 configs/build-version，数字宏与字符串须匹配，EXTRAVERSION、 LOCALVERSION 依次追加，再附加原生模块 ABI 身份后缀，完整版本最多 31 "
"字节。 ABI 身份由源码、配置、工具链和编译策略产生，不使用构建时钟或输出路径。 SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH 默认为提交时间。 htmldocs 只生成 "
"O/Documentation/html，不需要编译内核或初始化配置。"
msgstr ""
"The version comes from configs/build-version. Numeric macros and strings must agree; EXTRAVERSION "
"and LOCALVERSION are appended in that order, followed by the native module ABI identity suffix. "
"The full version is limited to 31 bytes. ABI identity is derived from source, configuration, "
"toolchain, and compilation policy, not the build clock or output path. SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH defaults "
"to the commit time. htmldocs generates only O/Documentation/html and requires neither a kernel "
"build nor configuration initialization."
